{"name": "A Short Quest", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras_big/aa19c473bdeb11c4c617364e6ea73a96.webp?t=1787778168\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/aa19c473bdeb11c4c617364e6ea73a96.avif?t=1787778168\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Short Quest is a first-person RPG developed by a 2 man indie team. Together we are building a lovingly crafted RPG set within the borders of a crumbling Kingdom. The king has gone mad, goblin raids have become commonplace and you are tasked with a seemingly simple task. Take a note of great importance to the king, and survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/3afcfec6a00e207e6b106d7738a3ec45.webp?t=1787778168\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/880438264c513f4988b42596c4ba0f76.poster.avif?t=1787778168\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/880438264c513f4988b42596c4ba0f76.webm?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/880438264c513f4988b42596c4ba0f76.mp4?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure through the kingdom's forests, caves, crypts, and swamps filled with fully voice acted NPCs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot chests deep below the surface, find hidden secrets in the tree-tops, and drink a beer in the tavern</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/eff84fba6992e3fe3bd2c16255cf7a65.webp?t=1787778168\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/8dc86dd2698f4d5b509967683b310532.poster.avif?t=1787778168\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/8dc86dd2698f4d5b509967683b310532.webm?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/8dc86dd2698f4d5b509967683b310532.mp4?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a  variety of weapons, spells, and tools to creatively overcome tough encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pit enemies against each other using a deep alliance system, friendly fire, or necromancy spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/0f2578a6b66d052be5060c59df425ae0.webp?t=1787778168\" width=\"600\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/b5ec8586b5760d593c3de0d6b65f681f.poster.avif?t=1787778168\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/b5ec8586b5760d593c3de0d6b65f681f.webm?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/extras/b5ec8586b5760d593c3de0d6b65f681f.mp4?t=1787778168\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience in combat and upgrade asymmetric melee and magic skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use items to discover their hidden properties via the Item Knowledge system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore a hand-crafted world, overcome brutally challenging combat, and restore order to a broken kingdom. Discover many unique weapons, tools, spells, and secrets in this short game inspired by old school action RPGs.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351810/465473ec7637c9c3170ecc36d77c8c7b48ac64ed/header.jpg?t=1787778168", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Action", "Exploration", "Dungeon Crawler", "Adventure", "Action-Adventure"], "developers": "Silent Moon", "publishers": "Silent Moon", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4351810", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "3 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/GWLWYonxrfw", "first_seen": 1772492400.0, "review_rank": 1061}